blocks.en:
We next restore bandwidth selection and simplify the full LAMP model on
the same four datasets. S1 replaces regional sets with whole-map descriptors;
S2 additionally removes support centering and diagonal normalization;
S3 further fixes the three layer weights to 1 / 3 1/3 .
LAMP, S1, and S2 each search 337 configurations, while S3 searches 22.
S1 thus uses the WHOLE representation with a larger bandwidth search.

blocks.zh:
我们接下来恢复带宽选择并简化 LAMP 模型
相同的四个数据集。 S1用全图描述符取代区域集;
S2还取消了支持中心和对角正常化;
S3进一步将三层的重量修正为 1/ 3 1/3.
LAMP,S1和S2各搜索337配置,而S3搜索22.
S1因此使用WHOLE代表并进行更大的带宽搜索.

